  "reviewMethod": "Root independently actually read all 188 complete five-field bilingual pairs alongside full frozen POS, meanings, variants and lexical evidence in untruncated show-review-pack ranges 0..62,63..125,126..187. Source-supported senses, actual POS/function, idiomatic argument structure, translation, neutral factual framing and study utility were judged individually. Four narrow precision findings were sent to author B, not silently corrected by reviewer. After author revision, root actually reread all four complete final pairs and their complete frozen objects in show-precision-delta: count up explicitly counts receipt amounts, cuddle up explicitly states sleep, dolled up explicitly says older sister, either way is now a clause adverb. Mechanical byte-and-row comparison independently established that all 184 other complete rows and head/order are unchanged from the fully read initial version. Both original/final raw hashes are pinned by the delta script; occurrence proof for give someone a ring was actually read and retains the person-slot realization. This is a genuine independent selected-sense AI language review, not exhaustive sense coverage or human certification."
